Package: kctl-env
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, curl, grep, sed, awk, coreutils
Description: Pure Bash kubectl version manager with fast shims and tfenv-style UX
 kctl-env manages kubectl versions per-project or globally, with context-aware
 auto-switching and strict SHA256 verification of downloaded binaries.
